[en.CHARACTER_PRINCESS_CELESTIA_C18_NAME]
Princess Celestia

[en.CHARACTER_PRINCESS_CELESTIA_C18_DESC]
Celestia has ruled Equestria for over a thousand years, but in the final moments of her reign, she was a bit hasty in choosing a successor. When Twilight Sparkle was not yet fully prepared to ascend, the invasion of the Big Three led to the fall of Equestria, and Celestia was imprisoned in Tartarus.
After the Fall of Tartarus, Queen Chrysalis declared Celestia dead, and Luna became the Nightmare Moon, becoming a puppet of Chrysalis. But in reality, Celestia did not die. She and her sister Luna arrived in the “Lokadhātu”, or the “Die Nebenwelt” - a parallel universe with subtle differences from this one.
With the opening of the Culanika Lokadhātu in the Kirin Commune, Celestia and Luna finally returned to this world. They are ready to correct their mistakes and restore harmony to Equestria.

[zh.CHARACTER_PRINCESS_CELESTIA_C18_NAME]
塞拉斯蒂娅公主

[zh.CHARACTER_PRINCESS_CELESTIA_C18_DESC]
塞拉斯蒂娅在小马利亚执政已逾千年，但在执政的最后时刻，选择继承者的问题上却有些操之过急。在暮光闪闪尚未完全准备好继位的时候，三巨头入侵导致了小马国的覆灭，塞拉斯蒂娅也被关押进塔尔塔罗斯监狱。
虽然塔尔塔洛斯陷落后，邪茧女王宣布塞拉斯蒂娅已经死亡，而露娜也化为梦魇之月，成为了邪茧的傀儡。但实际上，塞拉斯蒂娅并没有死去，她与妹妹露娜到达了“千界”，或者叫“新世界” —— 一个平行的世界线，与本世界线有着微妙的不同。
随着麒麟社群的千界之门打通，塞拉斯蒂娅和露娜也终于回到了本世界线，她们已经做好准备纠正自己犯下的错误，让谐律重归小马国。
